{"articleNo":"85420","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85420&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"대학「일부 건물명칭 변경 공모」 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.19","hit":"4170","attachments":[{"name":"공모전 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85420&attachNo=71571"},{"name":"시설명칭 공모 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85420&attachNo=71760"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 20pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><font color=\"#4174d9\">대학 「일부 건물명칭 변경 공모」 안내</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 20pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 현재 우리 대학 일부 건물의 명칭 중 사용용도에 따라 대학의 이미지와 부합되는 명칭으로 변경하고자 구성원을 대상으로 건물명칭 공모를 다음과 같이 진행하오니, 많은 참여 부탁드립니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 1. 대상건물 :<font color=\"#4174d9\"> </font></span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #2626ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#4174d9\">이오스관, 그린에너지관, 대외협력관</font></span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 2. 응모자격 : 대학 구성원(교직원, 학생 등)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 3. 응모기간 : <font color=\"#ff00dd\">2013. 6. 18.(화) ~&nbsp;6. 28.(금)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 4. 응모방법 :『응모신청서』를 작성하여 아래 방법으로 공모</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. E-mail : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #35a434; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\">kithongbo@kumoh.ac.kr</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. Fax : 054-478-7081</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 5. 체출처 : 기획협력처(대외협력홍보팀)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 6. 기타 응모내용에 대한 저작권은 금오공과대학교에 귀속됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 7. 심의 : 금오공과대학교 홍보및대외협력위원회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 8. 당선작 발표 및 시상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 발표 : <font color=\"#ff00dd\">2013. 7. 9.(화)&nbsp;</font> 홈페이지(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr)에 게재</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 시상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 당선작 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">건물별 각 1명</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 10만원 상당의 상품권 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (명칭 중복 응모자가 있을 경우 각 건물별 1명 추첨 선발)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 행운상 : 응모자 중 3명을 선정하여 5만원 상당의 상품권 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 9. 기타 사항은 기획협력처(전화 : 054-478-7077∼79)로 문의</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">10. 건물명 변경 후 조치사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 건물명 표지판 변경 : 대학시설 현황(책자), 조감도, 교내 시설 표지판</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 홈페이지내 건물 위치 및 약도 등 수정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 각종 홍보물(브로슈어 등)의 건물명 수정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임. 1) 공모전 안내 1부. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 시설명칭 공모 신청서 1부. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">기 획 협 력 처</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
